IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. P-36-STRING-OVERFLOW.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 A PIC X(6) VALUE "ABCDEF".
01 B PIC X(4) VALUE SPACES.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
STRING A DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO B ON OVERFLOW DISPLAY "OVERFLOW" NOT ON OVERFLOW DISPLAY B END-STRING
STOP RUN.
